                  standardized by NIST" but makes no explicit FIPS 205 / SLH-DSA
                  compliance claim. In the installed source tree,
                  quantcrypt/internal/constants.py maps class_name FAST_SPHINCS to
                  pqclean_name "sphincs-shake-256f-simple" and SMALL_SPHINCS to
                  "sphincs-shake-256s-simple". Author given as the repository owner
                  handle; no personal name was verified}
